msgstr "状态"

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:166
msgid ""
"On February 17, 2016, we are releasing ROS 2 alpha4, code-named **Duct "
"tape**. Our primary goal with this release is to add more features, while "
"also addressing the feedback we received for the previous releases. To that "
"end, we built a set of tutorials that show some of the key features of ROS "
"2. We encourage you to try out those demos, look at the code that implements "
"them, and `provide feedback <../../Contact>`. We're especially interested to "
"know how well (or poorly) we're addressing use cases that are important to "
"you."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:178
#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:240
