msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:301
msgid ""
"On November 3, 2015, we are releasing ROS 2 alpha2, code-named **Baling "
"wire**. Our primary goal with this release is to add more features, while "
"also addressing the feedback we received for the previous alpha 1 release. "
"To that end, we built a set of tutorials that show some of the key features "
"of ROS 2. We encourage you to try out those demos, look at the code that "
"implements them, and `provide feedback <../../Contact>`. We're especially "
"interested to know how well (or poorly) we're addressing use cases that are "
"important to you."
msgstr ""

